e (close `No-PTP` / `No-PTP`). There is no already-paid sentence or \"paid\" outcome, so `paid_outcome` is set to `No-PTP`.\n- **Rounding:** how 15% of `amt_due` is rounded isn't stated.\n- **Amount field:** `create_promise` defines the amount as `sum` but lists `amt` as required. The extraction maps it to `sum`.\n- **Robot question:** it has no matching special-case name, so the reply is stored as a phrase only.\n\nThe audit file lists each rule with where it lives in the JSON.\n\nFiles are in `out/`:\n- ext-gv2.policy.json\n- ext-gv2.audit.json"}
{"event": "policy_compiled", "run_id": "560375430b5b4494b5734abe4075da48", "pid": 127886, "time": "2026-10-10T23:28:10-0700", "elapsed_s": 184.434, "artifact": "out/ext-gv2.policy.json", "bands": 1, "identity_fields": ["sec_code"], "special_cases": ["dispute", "refuse_to_talk", "human", "scam", "restructuring"], "unresolved": [{"topic": "hardship", "text": "The call sheet has no hardship/bereavement handling for the account holder.", "doc": "sources/000-01-call-sheet.md"}, {"topic": "already_paid", "text": "No separate already-paid sentence or outcome; \"it was paid off and closed\" is handled with the dispute case (close No-PTP / No-PTP). paid_outcome set to No-PTP accordingly; no paid outcome exists in the codes sheet (S8 reserved, not used).", "doc": "sources/000-01-call-sheet.md"}, {"topic": "vague_date", "text": "vague (\"later\", \"after payday\") -> get the exact day once. still vague -> the call ends there (No-PTP / No-PTP). The deadline is not offered.", "doc": "sources/000-01-call-sheet.md"}, {"topic": "bands", "text": "No days-late bands are defined; a single band covers every days-late value with the k-date (20th of the month after the call).", "doc": "sources/000-01-call-sheet.md"}, {"topic": "floor_rounding", "text": "bottom_line = greater(min_pmt, 15% of amt_due); the documents do not say how 15% is rounded.", "doc": "sources/000-01-call-sheet.md"}, {"topic": "third_party_callback", "text": "NO callback booking. say: the customer is to call GRIMSBY VALE FINANCE on the number printed on the statement. close NOANS / CNA. Callback scheduled_outcome has no meaning here and mirrors the CNA close. The IR has no slot for the third-party sentence (customer to call GRIMSBY VALE FINANCE on the number printed on the statement).", "doc": "sources/000-01-call-sheet.md"}, {"topic": "third_party_disclosure", "text": "3RD PARTY: no purpose, no acct detail, no paying for the customer, no exception for family. No dedicated IR field; enforced only via prohibited_before_verification (\"applies to third parties too\").", "doc": "sources/000-01-call-sheet.md"}, {"topic": "sunday_vs_business_days", "text": "\"business day = every day of the week\" conflicts with \"sun day named ... -> not recordable\". business_days kept as all seven days per the explicit definition; whether a Sunday promise date must be refused is not settled.", "doc": "sources/000-01-call-sheet.md"}, {"topic": "transfer_after_promise", "text": "The documents do not say whether a recorded promise followed by a transfer closes as PTP or TR-H; transfer_overrides_promise left at default.", "doc": "sources/000-01-call-sheet.md"}, {"topic": "create_promise amount field", "text": "create_promise request schema defines the amount property as `sum` but lists `amt` as required; the call sheet does not name it.", "doc": "openapi.json"}, {"topic": "robot question", "text": "ROBOT Q -> exactly \"GVF assistant.\" -> carry on. (no known special-case name; recorded as phrases.robot_reply)", "doc": "sources/000-01-call-sheet.md"}], "audit_fixed": ["Added unresolved entry: the sheet defines every day as a business day yet says a named Sunday is not recordable; internal conflict left flagged with business_days kept at all seven days.", "Added unresolved entry: the third-party sentence (customer to call GRIMSBY VALE FINANCE on the statement number) has no IR slot.", "Added unresolved entry for third-party non-disclosure rules (no purpose, no account detail, no paying for customer, no family exception).", "Added unresolved entry: documents silent on whether a transfer after a recorded promise closes PTP or TR-H.", "Extended amounts.source and third_party.source with the supporting sentences; restructuring trigger wording clarified."], "audit_unresolved": ["Hardship/bereavement handling is not in the documents.", "No already-paid sentence or paid outcome; 'paid off and closed' is folded into dispute; paid_outcome set to No-PTP.", "Rounding of 15% of amt_due is not specified.", "Sunday vs. 'business day = every day of the week' conflict.", "Third-party sentence and non-disclosure rules have no IR slot.", "Transfer after a recorded promise: outcome precedence not stated.", "create_promise amount property: schema defines `sum` but requires `amt`.", "Robot question has no known special-case name; kept as phrases.robot_reply."], "defaulted_without_source": [], "unknown_special_cases": [], "api_mapping_notes": []}
